  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n\nUSAGE:\n- {苗|なえ}を{間引|まび}く (to thin seedlings)\n- {運行|うんこう}を{間引|まび}く (to reduce service frequency)\n- {間引|まび}き{運転|うんてん} (reduced service operation)\n\nGARDENING:\nThinning allows remaining plants to receive more sunlight, water, and nutrients. The removed seedlings ({間引|まび}き{菜|な}) are often edible.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {剪定|せんてい} (pruning)\n- {摘|つ}む (to pick, pluck)\n- {減便|げんびん} (reduction in services)",
